# Runtime directories must exist in a fresh clone (CI3 silently drops logs if
# storage/logs is missing), but their contents are never source.
*
!.gitignore
!logs/
!cache/
# The attachment store must exist in a fresh clone with its deny guard in
# place; the customer documents inside it are never source.
!ticket_attachments/
ticket_attachments/*
!ticket_attachments/.htaccess
!ticket_attachments/index.html
